# Licensed webfonts — private asset rail, never committed (PP EULA; B14 2026-08-18).
# Hydrate locally with: cd code/apps/microsite-astro && pnpm fetch:fonts
code/apps/microsite-astro/public/fonts/PP*.woff2
representation/visual-system/typography/subsets/nav/pangram-sans-800.woff2
representation/visual-system/typography/subsets/wordmark/editorial-new-700.woff2

# Visual baselines are CI-linux ONLY (ADR-0003 §Stage 4: "Baselines must be
# generated in the CI linux runner, not the Mac — documented rendering
# variance"). A local `playwright test visual.spec.ts` run writes -darwin
# files for any missing snapshot; committing one would enshrine a Mac render
# as the floor. The e2e `update-visual-baselines` workflow_dispatch is the
# only sanctioned baseline factory.
*-chromium-darwin.png
